        "content": "<p>One way to define the notion of a tree is as a prefix-closed set of finite sequences:<br>\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tree_(descriptive_set_theory)\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tree_(descriptive_set_theory)</a><br>\nDoes a definition like this exist in mathlib?</p>",
