        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1784759357
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh, never mind.  I found it: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/SetTheory/Descriptive/Tree.html\">https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/SetTheory/Descriptive/Tree.html</a></p>",
